  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Amancha Prem Kiran vs The State Of Telangana on 21 August, 2025 Hon'Ble Smt. Justice Tirumala Devi Eada Criminal Petition No.10650 of 2025 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed under Section 528 Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 (for short 'BNSS') by the petitioners-accused No.6 seeking to quash the proceedings against him in CC No.1566 of 2019 on the file of V Additional Judicial Magistrate of First Class, Warangal, registered for the alleged offences punishable under Sections 420, 270, 273 IPC and 57 & 58 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that the matter is squarely covered by the orders of this Hon'ble Court in Crl.P.Nos.12333 of 2024, 152 of 2020 and batch and in several other judgments. Hence, he prayed that the proceedings against the petitioners be [LEAKAGE_MASK]. 4. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor also submitted that the issue raised in the present criminal petition is covered by the earlier order passed in the aforementioned criminal petitions.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that the matter is squarely covered by the orders of this Hon'ble Court in Crl.P.Nos.12333 of 2024, 152 of 2020 and batch and in several other judgments.",
    "respondent_arguments": "Hence, he prayed that the proceedings against the petitioners be [LEAKAGE_MASK]. 4. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor also submitted that the issue raised in the present criminal petition is covered by the earlier order passed in the aforementioned criminal petitions.",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
